  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">YY Goshti Incubator Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The YY Goshti Incubator Project aims to support 60 start-ups in a dynamic, centrally located facility in Bangladesh (Mirpur). Young entrepreneurs can collaborate and work with like-minded individuals to start scaling up their businesses. The incubation program offers training, business development support, master classes, events and coaching- &amp; mentoring sessions. The ultimate goal of this project is to strengthen the Bangladeshi start-up ecosystem and to combat youth unemployment.</narrative>
  </description>
